      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_16",
        on: "branch_if_16",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "Siddry_stored",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "gold",
            side: 1,
            amount: 20,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_16",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$spy_unit.id",
            text: _("<small>(_ (whisper) Kai, I heard Caladon muttering about the sword. I think he may try to take it for himself.)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("<small>(_ Thank you, $spy_unit.name|. I will keep that in mind, but it may be hard for us to stop him with that teleporting trick he has.)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Caladon",
            text: _("Here we are. There’s a castle up ahead in the fog. That’s where Agnovon has the sword."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("The lich is Agnovon?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Caladon",
            text: _("Well, he calls himself Mal-Govon now, but yes. He called this land the KINGDOM of Agnovon. He was its first king. And its last. And each one in between too! He kept getting older and older, but he never died. Well, NOW he’s dead of course. He still putters around in that castle over there, but he hasn’t really cared about keeping his kingdom under control for a good long while. I bet I can wake him up, though. Watch THIS!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Suddenly, Caladon’s strident voice shrieked out louder than seemed possible, as if there were dozens of men shouting at once."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Caladon",
            text: _("AGNOVON, I’VE COME FOR YOUR SWORD! TODAY YOU WILL REMEMBER FEAR! Heh heh. Nice trick, huh?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("A voice came back like wind moaning through dry leaves. Though it was only whispered, all heard it better than they wanted."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal-Govon",
            text: _("What I remember, you old fool, is you leaving behind the smoldering bodies of the orcs you had hired to steal my sword. Now, you bring merfolk to do your dirty work. When they lie expiring like gasping fish on the shore, will you not flee again? Do not speak to <i>me</i> of fear."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("We are here of our own accord, and we will take that sword."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal-Govon",
            text: _("The merman speaks. Tell it to go away, Caladon, if it doesn’t want to get hurt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("That does it. Attack!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Caladon",
            text: _("A word of warning, young Kai. I carry a staff of righteous FLAME. If you let me die, I will take YOU all with me!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_19",
        on: "branch_if_19",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "Siddry_stored",
            not_equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "Siddry_stored.x",
            value: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "Siddry_stored.y",
            value: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "Siddry_stored.hitpoints",
            value: 37,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "Siddry_stored.moves",
            value: "$Siddry_stored.max_moves",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "Siddry_stored.attacks_left",
            value: "$Siddry_stored.max_attacks",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "Siddry_stored",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Siddry",
            text: _("Kai Krellis! What are you doing here? I thought you were traveling south when I met you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("Friend Siddry!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howyrth",
            text: _("You know each other?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Siddry",
            text: _("Kai Krellis is the one who saved me from slavery, Howyrth. I told him I would repay him if I could, and here is my chance. My friends and I will join you in your fight, Kai Krellis. We are yours to command, and we refuse to be paid."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Lyllan",
            type: "Footpad",
            side: 1,
            x: 17,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Lyllan",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Lyllan",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Trudd",
            type: "Thug",
            side: 1,
            x: 17,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Trudd",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Trudd",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Dorcyn",
            type: "Thug",
            side: 1,
            x: 19,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Dorcyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Dorcyn",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_20",
        on: "branch_if_20",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "Siddry_stored",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Dorcyn",
            type: "Footpad",
            side: 1,
            x: 17,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Dorcyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dorcyn",
            text: _("I’ll join you right now! That monster is just unnatural."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_18",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2217%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2219%22%2C%22radius%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Howyrth",
            type: "Outlaw",
            side: 3,
            x: 17,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Howyrth",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howyrth",
            text: _("Hello there! Who are you? Were you the ones shouting about taking a sword?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("I am Kai Krellis of Jotha. I am attempting to defeat Mal-Govon and take his sword. Will you join us in battle against a common enemy?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howyrth",
            text: _("I don’t know if that creature really is our enemy. He has never bothered us, and I should stay at my post anyway. However, I’m sure many townsfolk would welcome the extra income if you want to hire them. I guess we would be happy to get rid of the monster just in case."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You can now recruit human villagers, but you will not be able to recall them in future scenarios."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Trapper, Bandit, Poacher, Thug, Footpad, Peasant, Woodsman, Ruffian",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_19",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_20",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_21",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
